{"name":"The Match Key","slug":"glyph-match-key","blurb":"On the veto street, Wren carries the key toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Match. Click the key and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Match Key.","seal":"7ca26bb52f527b1a45181d41078400279f52f03293f3d04cbe230d90d08c36d5"}
